go 1.26

toolchain go1.26.6

// Deliberately a single-module workspace, mirroring gzh-cli-quality (605ea39).
// It is tracked to stop `go` from walking up into the devbox checkout's own
// go.work, which lists all eleven sibling modules — not to wire ../gzh-cli-core
// in here. Naming a sibling is what broke this: outside a devbox layout it does
// not exist, so every `go` invocation that does not set GOWORK=off failed
// before it started. Cross-repo local development goes through `make local-dev`
// in the devbox, which is the documented mechanism.
use .
